      ["one Issue row and its raw result JSON, if stored", "what the rule id, impact, tags, and selector look like in practice"],
      ["the check catalog and scoring config files (Q34, Q35)", "which axe rules count, at what weight, and which produce manual-review flags"]
    ],
    terms: [["Rule", "one automated test with an id such as color-contrast"], ["Impact", "axe's minor, moderate, serious, critical"], ["Incomplete", "results that need a human decision"], ["Tags", "WCAG level and version labels on each rule"], ["Best-practice rules", "axe rules that are not WCAG requirements; whether they count is a scoring decision"]],
    resources: [
