  pdfplumber: {
    why: "Campus sites publish PDFs, and PDF accessibility is its own problem: a document can be a picture of text with nothing a screen reader can use. The scanner fetches documents separately and needs a way to read what is inside them. pdfplumber is a Python library that extracts text, characters with positions, and tables from a PDF.",
